{"id":"vod_zy360_67700","vodId":"67700","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"小小克星！Refrain","name_cn":"小小克星！Refrain","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至21集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241105-1/0d2fbafd85ef2af41c2ccfb0ced48614.jpg"},"summary":"幼时曾深陷绝望深渊的直枝理树，与4位少年少女相遇了。在那之后数年，理树作为LittleBusters的一员，喧闹地过着快乐的每一天。这样的时间能够一直持续就好了。理树所期望的只有这样。某日，恭介突然表示要成立一支棒球队伍，理树则开始了寻找成员的任务。在这样的过程中，理树邂逅了新的成员们。和大家一起参加试胆大会，潜入女生宿舍时被换上女装，一起演人偶剧……。经历了许多快乐的事情，同时也在大家的帮助下解决了各自拥有的烦恼。最后在棒球比赛中，理树确认了和最好的朋友们之间的牵绊。——然而，这并不是结束。和来谷唯湖之间的故事。理树与铃的故事。以及，理树和铃终于知晓的“世界的秘密”。LittleBusters真正的物语，自此开始——。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-05 19:31:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":21,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/oj3XJBVg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/trjZwqlO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/JV1Lh5Fp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/uzO8IBbe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/kN11aIDd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/Okl3sBaI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/d8oai6Uf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/Bzh1Gpp8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/LkipA3jd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/gw2AoahZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/qbzrX5c1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/Dm3e2TUi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/X79HWhjN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/eqBkyB1N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"h